From: Ely Office
Subject: LOK: Impress puts a picture file on a slide by index

- .uno:ElySlideImage (Slide, Url, Width) loads the picture at Url and
  centers it on slide Slide, at its natural size or Width (twips), the
  height following, shrunk to fit inside the slide's borders, in one
  undo step, without switching the shown slide or changing the
  selection.
- A file that is no picture, or a slide that does not exist, leaves the
  presentation as it was.

